// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Albert Maurer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4264732256" "Albert Maurer"
// ProfessionString :
"P2289973785" "Superpowered Activites Monitoring Special Agent"
// DescriptionString :
"P856364347" ""
// LocationString :
"P3637129972" "Talos Island"
// HelloString :
"P2574765726" "Ah. {HeroName}, you're back.  Have you anything to report?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1922986849" "Hello, {HeroName}. I've heard of the work you've done, keep it up. You and I have nothing to work on together...at the moment."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2274161194" "We still haven't been able to track down any new information from the report you brought us, {HeroName}.  Until that time, please continue defending the good people of our nation.  If anything turns up, we'll be in touch."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2588262196" "You're working on too many things as it is, {HeroName}. Come back when you've got a moment."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P2539071072" "I'm terribly sorry, but I don't believe you and I have any common business to discuss."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2472804946" "How is it that you can see my FailsafeLevelString?  That should be impossible, unless we've raised the level cap or you're peeking through .pigg files."
// IntroString :
"P2104308327" "Agent Adair is my superior who believes that all these events prove a theory she has. She has requested that you speak with her to continue with this investigation."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2072259992" "Speak with Special Agent Jenni Adair"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3052707147" "Good luck."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4038861564" "There is someone who would like to meet with you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1818465485" "There are some people who have been inquiring about you."
