// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Field Agent Keith Nance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P30098905" "Field Agent Keith Nance"
// ProfessionString :
"P1666085832" "Superpowered Activites Monitoring Field Agent"
// DescriptionString :
"P1169921310" "Field Agent Keith Nance works for S.A.M., a supposed branch of the FBSA responsible for monitoring superpowered activities throughout the nation.  It's a very rare thing to see one of these agents in the field; usually it means they're performing some type of high level investigation."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P4191309418" "Let's get moving, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P731281755" "It's good to meet you, {HeroName}.  You're a bit shorter than I thought you'd be.  I don't really have much time to talk, since you're not on the persons of interest list.  Keep up the good work. Have a good day."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P509363256" "Your work here is done, {HeroName}.  If you haven't already reported to Special Agent Adair, it would really be in everyone's best interests that you did so ASAP."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2684354179" "This is very serious business, {HeroName}, and S.A.M. needs your total cooperation.  Finish your other duties before offering your services to the nation."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P157838530" "As much as we need to keep working together on this, for your sake, I can't in good conscience allow you to walk into something that could get you killed.  We'll take care of the current issue at hand with our own operatives until you're better able to handle the gravity of this situation, {HeroName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P4191008001" "Word has it that some guy by the name of Keith Nance has been asking a lot of questions about you recently.  You might want to find out what all the interest in you is about."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1792964049" "Speak with Field Agent Keith Nance"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2297213930" "Agent Adair may have some odd theories, but she has plenty of experience dealing with super-powered issues."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3570060198" "I can tell you what you need to know about Agent Adair."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P3444605179" "{HeroName}, good to see you're deciding to come along quietly. Just wait here and we'll have our boys from S.A.M. down here in just a moment to arrest you. I'm surprised, however, that you opted to-"
// Answer Text :
"P2642012870" "Hold on, arrest me?"
// Answer Text :
"P110952470" "Try to arrest me, I dare you."
// Page Option1A Text :
"P2143095829" "Don't be coy, {HeroName}. All those people you killed in Arizona? What about over near the Great Lakes?<br><br>You've done too many horrific things to just be let off the hook. What I still don't get is, why Paragon?<br><br>You've been using the city to cover up your schemes around the country, making people focus on the good you do here, while you go out and commit all these crimes everywhere else.<br><br>But now, you've got the gall to try to do these things in <i>this</i> city? Do you think you can get away with it?"
// Answer Text :
"P1783547734" "I haven't -done- anything. You've got the wrong person."
// Page GoToD Text :
"P3810394706" "<color orange>Agent Nance's phone rings. You see the caller is 'JENNI ADAIR' on his phone. He steps away from you to whisper into the phone, his eyes beneath his glasses keeping a close watch on you. After a few moments, he hangs up the phone, his mouth twitching in irritation.</color><br><br>So, you say you haven't done anything I just mentioned?<br><br>I don't believe you, but one of my superiors does. She wants me to request your help in this investigation, regarding <color red>the other you</color>. Or so she says."
// Answer Text :
"P4178608997" "I'll help you, but you need to level with me about what's going on."
// Page GoToJ Text :
"P2361456956" "I suppose it can't hurt. I'm either telling you information you already know, or revealing the truth to you.<br><br>Just so you know, I doubt it's the latter. My superior may believe you, but it's only because she wants to prove one of her theories.<br><br>We've had reports that <i>you</i> have been spreading chaos in various parts of the United States. When you haven't been attacking parts of the nation, you've been here, 'saving the day' as it were. We haven't received any reports of both events happening at the same time, but now you're here, talking with me. While my superior says you're <i>also</i> at the Faultline Dam."
// Answer Text :
"P2431210897" "Hrm. Give me a moment to prepare, then we'll handle this."
// Page GoToB Text :
"P2510864379" "Not surprised, {HeroName}. I figured you wouldn't come quietly. I've got agents that I can call to swarm this area within five minutes.<br><br>Do you really want to cause a scene here, in this part of Talos? Or did you come talk to me precisely to do that?"
// Answer Text :
"P1276198307" "Call the agents, I'm ready for a fight."
// Page GoToF Text :
"P1745196363" "<color orange>Agent Nance's phone rings. You see the caller is 'JENNI ADAIR' on his phone. He steps away from you to whisper into the phone, his eyes beneath his glasses keep a close watch on you. After a few moments, he hangs up the phone, his mouth twitching in irritation.</color><br><br>.....<br><br>I've been told to back down, {HeroName}. But don't think I'm going to forget what <i>almost</i> happened here.<br><br>My superiors tell me that we've got movement by <i>you</i> in Faultline. And I've been told to 'request' your aid in the investigation."
// Answer Text :
"P1668361493" "Tell me what's going on, and maybe I'll help. Maybe."
// Page GoToL Text :
"P560889593" "I suppose it can't hurt. I'm either telling you information you already know, or revealing the truth to you.<br><br>Just so you know, I doubt it's the latter. My superior may believe you, but it's only because she wants to prove one of her theories.<br><br>We've had reports that <i>you</i> have been spreading chaos in various parts of the United States. When you haven't been attacking parts of the nation, you've been here, 'saving the day' as it were. We haven't received any reports of both events happening at the same time, but now you're here, talking with me. So if you want to track down this 'other' you, I suggest we work together. Until you show your true colors, that is."
// Answer Text :
"P652949391" "I'll be back when I'm good and ready to help you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


