// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Mistress Eva 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3745319930" "Mistress Eva"
// ProfessionString :
"P2787450600" "Mistress of the Carnival of Light"
// DescriptionString :
"P3100432727" "Mistress Eva is one of the talented mystics who serve as leaders of the Praetorian Carnival of Light, and is one of Vanessa DeVore's most trusted friends. As such, when Vanessa needed to send one of her people to Primal Earth to recruit prospective assistance in First Ward, Eva was at the top of the list. She now stands vigil along the cliffs of New Corinth, maintaining the link to Praetoria while awaiting the arrival of those willing to aid the Carnival in First Ward."
// LocationString :
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2116187179" "I cannot reveal my secrets to you at this time.<br><br><color orange>You must become a VIP or purchase the First Ward from the Paragon Market in order to access this contact."
// HelloString :
"P1239812839" "Welcome, {HeroName}. I am Mistress Eva of the Carnival of Light, and I am here to ask for your assistance."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3540809583" "I'm sorry, but you are not who I am looking for. However, I'm sure there are countless other deeds that you could accomplish in this world that are more fitting to your level of power."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1676764976" "It would seem the whispers are true. This truly is a world of opposites. But to you, my world must seem bizarre and backwards as well, so similar they are but with so many differences too.<br><br>I am Mistress Eva, and I bring a message from the Carnival of Light to the heroes of this world. We need your help against a great stirring evil, and if it is not stopped, then it will consume us all."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1320073166" "I was sent to recruit heroes from your world, not its champions. There are greater threats that you and only you can face. This is a fight that others must undertake."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3498033018" "Your fate is twisted, knotted, and pulled in all directions. The people of Nowhere need someone who can devote their undivided attention to their safety. Take care of your current affairs and then we can talk about new ones."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P561143750" "I fear you are not yet powerful enough to face what evil lurks in Nowhere. See me again when you are, as Powers Division would say, security level 20."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1975675677" "I think I like it here, in your world. You people seem friendly enough."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4098071517" "I feel that I can trust you, {HeroName}. And so does the Carnival of Light."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


