// Name :
"P2851539753" "Special Agent Jenni Adair"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2128572620" "Special Agent Jenni Adair works for S.A.M., a supposed branch of the FBSA responsible for monitoring superpowered activities throughout the nation.  It's a very rare thing to see one of these agents in the field; usually it means they're performing some type of high level investigation."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// PlayerBusyString :
// ComeBackLaterString :
// BadgeNeededString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
